# THE DRIP-WARDEN'S BODY (the Limestone Caves' keeper, for review before any of
# its fight): a riser mast on three raked legs limed past the knees, the drip
# crown at its top with its own stalactites grown from the rim and dripping, the
# pump pack and its slurry tank at the hip, the spray lance on the mast. Seen
# whole at eye level under a tear in the roof, and in a lidded hall by its own
# light and by the lamp.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/drip_warden.tour --seed=7 --realm=underground --hour=12
coast calm
wait 1.0
near under_roof
wait 1.0
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
# Over the shoulder, put down from the pool's edge: it stands in the column the
# tear lets down. Then stood off it on its own level, facing it.
near shaft_pool
wait 1.0
spawn sentinel.limestone_caves
near mob:sentinel.limestone_caves 7.5
wait 1.2
shot 01-under-a-tear with shoulder,mob:sentinel.limestone_caves
# Away from the shaft, under the lid: run off down the hall in the top view,
# then stand under the nearest roof there.
tap shoulder
await top_view 3
walk 1,0 9 run
near under_roof
wait 1.0
spawn sentinel.limestone_caves
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
near mob:sentinel.limestone_caves 7.5
wait 1.2
shot 02-in-a-lidded-hall with shoulder,mob:sentinel.limestone_caves
tap lamp
wait 0.8
shot 03-in-a-lidded-hall-by-the-lamp with shoulder,lamp,mob:sentinel.limestone_caves
